---
source: crates/efr-cli/src/commands/logout/tests.rs
expression: "shown.join(\"\\n\")"
---
$ efr logout anthropic
logged out of anthropic-api. The key stays valid at Anthropic; revoke it in the Claude Console.
efr: warning: anthropic-api stays the provider of new conversations ([model] provider), so its turns fail until you log in again; log in with: efr login anthropic

$ efr logout openai-api
logged out of openai-api. The key stays valid at OpenAI; revoke it in the dashboard of the OpenAI platform.
efr: warning: openai-api stays the provider of new conversations ([model] provider), so its turns fail until you log in again; log in with: efr login openai-api

$ efr logout openai
logged out of openai-subscription
efr: warning: openai-subscription stays the provider of new conversations ([model] provider), so its turns fail until you log in again; log in with: efr login openai
